      "text": "agent_runtimeImplementation\n运行核心承托面\n\n它做三件事：\n1. 创建/持有 runtime\n2. 暴露 surface 与 capability\n3. 把调用路由到执行、模型、接口\n\n它不直接实现全部副作用。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "agent_runtimeImplementation\n运行核心承托面\n\n它做三件事：\n1. 创建/持有 runtime\n2. 暴露 surface 与 capability\n3. 把调用路由到执行、模型、接口\n\n它不直接实现全部副作用。",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "aB",
      "autoResize": true
