      "text": "runtime 内部关系\n\nsurfaceRegistry 先登记可用面；\ncapabilityExposure 把能力暴露出去；\ninvocationMethod 接收调用；\nbehaviorExposure 记录事件；\nmanagementPlane 管理 runtime。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "runtime 内部关系\n\nsurfaceRegistry 先登记可用面；\ncapabilityExposure 把能力暴露出去；\ninvocationMethod 接收调用；\nbehaviorExposure 记录事件；\nmanagementPlane 管理 runtime。",
