      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "runtimeSurfaceRegistry\n\n负责登记 runtime \n当前有哪些 surface。\n产出：surface 列表、\nready/mounted 状态。\n下游：capabilityExposure、\ninspection/debug。",
