      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776919567150,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "工具链结论：不要在 CLI 里手写一套工具系统。CLI 只能提供 host executor；能力暴露、调用 envelope、执行桥、行为事件必须来自 agentCore。",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "工具链结论：不要在 CLI 里手写一套工具系统。CLI 只能提供 host executor；能力暴露、调用 envelope、执行桥、行为事件必须来自 agentCore。",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "b1S",
      "autoResize": true
    },
