      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "功能重塑闭环\n\n1. 看日志发现问题\n2. 判断是 tool 文件、runtime surface、\nmodel adapter 还是 host executor 的责任\n3. 改对应模块\n4. 再跑 tool lab 复测",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "功能重塑闭环\n\n1. 看日志发现问题\n2. 判断是 tool 文件、runtime surface、\nmodel adapter 还是 host executor 的责任\n3. 改对应模块\n4. 再跑 tool lab 复测",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "b2P",
      "autoResize": true
    },
